<!-- HERO -->
<section style="position:relative;min-height:560px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;overflow:hidden;">
  <img src="/images/hero-panorama.webp" alt="Nigeria landscape" width="2000" height="950" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high">
  <div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(10,61,92,0.55) 0%, rgba(10,61,92,0.25) 55%, rgba(10,61,92,0.45) 100%);"></div>
  <div style="position:relative;max-width:880px;padding:96px 24px 130px;">
    <span style="display:inline-block;margin-bottom:18px;padding:7px 18px;border-radius:999px;font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.14);color:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.35);backdrop-filter:blur(3px);">Engineering-led · Nigeria</span>
    <h1 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:800;color:#fff;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-0.015em;font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,58px);margin:0 0 18px;text-shadow:0 2px 24px rgba(10,61,92,0.45);">Steam Turbine Overhaul, Turbine and Generator Services in Nigeria</h1>
    <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.92);max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 30px;text-shadow:0 1px 12px rgba(10,61,92,0.5);">Axiom Power Services overhauls steam and gas turbines, maintains industrial generators and corrects rotating equipment faults for plants operating in Lagos, Rivers, FCT, Kaduna, Delta and Kano States. Send an enquiry and an engineer discusses the machine, the symptoms and your outage window before anything is quoted, then we arrange a site survey and put the scope and cost in writing.</p>
    <div style="display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
      <a href="tel:+2348030000000" class="btn-green" style="font-size:15px;padding:16px 38px;">Call an engineer — +234 803 000 0000</a>
      <a href="/#contact" class="btn-white-outline" style="font-size:15px;">Request a Written Proposal</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <svg class="swoosh" style="position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;" viewBox="0 0 1440 70" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0,70 C360,10 1080,10 1440,70 L1440,70 L0,70 Z" fill="#ffffff"/></svg>
</section>

<!-- INTRO -->
<section style="padding:84px 24px 64px;background:#fff;">
  <div class="intro-grid" style="max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:0.9fr 1.1fr;gap:64px;align-items:center;">
    <div style="position:relative;">
      <div style="border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 24px 56px rgba(10,61,92,0.22);aspect-ratio:1/1;">
        <img src="/images/about.webp" alt="Axiom Power Services service crew" width="1024" height="1024" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="lazy">
      </div>
      <div style="position:absolute;bottom:-18px;right:-14px;background:#2FA34D;color:#fff;border-radius:14px;padding:14px 22px;box-shadow:0 10px 26px rgba(47,163,77,0.4);">
        <p style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;margin:0;line-height:1;">24/7</p>
        <p style="font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;margin:4px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;">Support Line</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="kicker">Turbine, generator and rotating equipment engineering</span>
      <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,40px);margin:0 0 18px;">Every Scope Starts With Measurement, Not With a Parts List</h2>
      <div class="rich"><p>Axiom Power Services is a Lagos based turbine and rotating equipment outfit serving industrial and commercial plants across Nigeria. Our engineers work on back pressure and condensing steam turbines, industrial and aeroderivative gas turbines, diesel and gas generator sets, and the pumps, compressors, fans and gearboxes coupled to them. The work is deliberately narrow: <a href="/steam-turbine-overhaul-nigeria/">turbine overhaul</a>, <a href="/generator-maintenance-nigeria/">generator maintenance</a> and <a href="/rotating-equipment-services-nigeria/">rotating equipment correction</a>, carried out by people who spend their time on machines rather than on general electrical contracting.</p><p>Most of the plants we are called into are not failing because of machine age. They are failing because duty cycles have drifted far from what the original maintenance plan assumed, because grid instability turns standby sets into prime movers, and because dust, fuel quality and humidity load the machine in ways the manual never priced in. A <a href="/power-plant-audit-nigeria/">power plant audit</a> puts numbers on that drift, and our <a href="/generator-turbine-maintenance-cost/">cost guidance</a> shows how scope, spares and downtime combine into the figure you eventually approve.</p></div>
      <a href="/about/" class="btn-blue" style="margin-top:10px;">More About Us</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .intro-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; gap: 44px !important; } }
</style>

<!-- TILES -->
<section id="services" style="padding:72px 24px 84px;background:#EAF5FB;">
  <div style="max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;">
    <span class="kicker">Outage support available</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,40px);margin:0 0 40px;">What Is Taking Your Plant Off Load?</h2>
    <div class="tile-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:22px;">
      <a href="/steam-turbine-overhaul-nigeria/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(10,61,92,0.1);">
        <img src="/images/service-1.webp" alt="Steam turbine rotor lifted out of its casing during a major overhaul" width="700" height="560" style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.25/1;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="lazy">
        <span style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;padding:14px 12px;">Steam and Gas Turbine Overhaul</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/generator-maintenance-nigeria/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(10,61,92,0.1);">
        <img src="/images/service-2.webp" alt="Engineer servicing a containerised industrial diesel generator at a factory" width="700" height="560" style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.25/1;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="lazy">
        <span style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;padding:14px 12px;">Industrial Generator Maintenance</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/rotating-equipment-services-nigeria/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(10,61,92,0.1);">
        <img src="/images/service-3.webp" alt="Laser shaft alignment being carried out on a pump and motor coupling" width="700" height="560" style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.25/1;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="lazy">
        <span style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;padding:14px 12px;">Vibration, Alignment and Balancing</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/power-plant-audit-nigeria/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(10,61,92,0.1);">
        <img src="/images/service-4.webp" alt="Engineers reviewing plant load and fuel data during a power plant audit" width="700" height="560" style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.25/1;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="lazy">
        <span style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;padding:14px 12px;">Power Plant Audit and Condition Survey</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/blog/gas-turbine-trip-causes/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(10,61,92,0.1);">
        <img src="/images/tile-1.webp" alt="Control room screen showing a gas turbine trip alarm during loading" width="700" height="560" style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.25/1;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="lazy">
        <span style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;padding:14px 12px;">Gas Turbine Tripping Under Load</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/blog/generator-low-output-causes/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(10,61,92,0.1);">
        <img src="/images/tile-2.webp" alt="Generator control panel showing output well below the rated kVA" width="700" height="560" style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.25/1;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="lazy">
