        <span style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;padding:14px 12px;">Dust Fouling and Harmattan Derating</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/blog/turbine-overhaul-vs-replacement/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(10,61,92,0.1);">
