</style>

<!-- SERVICE CARDS -->
<section style="padding:0 24px 80px;background:#EAF5FB;">
  <div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <div class="svc-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:20px;">
      <a href="/steam-turbine-overhaul-nigeria/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:12px;padding:30px 26px;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.06);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 10px;">Steam & Gas Turbine Overhaul</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0 0 18px;flex:1;">Combustion, hot gas path and major inspections on industrial gas turbines, plus rotor, diaphragm, gland and bearing work on back pressure and condensing steam sets. Borescope findings, clearance readings and torque records are handed over with the machine so the next window can be planned from data.</p>
        <span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#2FA34D;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;">Learn More &#8594;</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/generator-maintenance-nigeria/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:12px;padding:30px 26px;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.06);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 10px;">Industrial Generator Maintenance</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0 0 18px;flex:1;">Scheduled servicing, AVR and governor tuning, synchronising and protection checks, and load bank testing for diesel and gas sets from a few hundred kVA up to synchronised multi megawatt banks. We correct the wet stacking, injector fouling and cooling losses that come from long hours at low load.</p>
        <span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#2FA34D;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;">Learn More &#8594;</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/rotating-equipment-services-nigeria/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:12px;padding:30px 26px;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.06);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 10px;">Rotating Equipment Services</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0 0 18px;flex:1;">Vibration surveys, laser shaft alignment, field and workshop balancing, and bearing, seal and coupling replacement on pumps, compressors, fans, blowers and gearboxes. Faults are traced to a cause and a measurement rather than replaced part by part until the symptom goes quiet.</p>
        <span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#2FA34D;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;">Learn More &#8594;</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/power-plant-audit-nigeria/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:12px;padding:30px 26px;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.06);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 10px;">Power Plant Audit and Plant Assessment</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0 0 18px;flex:1;">A structured survey of generation and load profile, fuel burn per kWh, redundancy gaps, protection settings and deferred maintenance across the site. You receive a written condition register and a costed intervention plan your procurement team can act on.</p>
        <span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#2FA34D;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;">Learn More &#8594;</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  @media (max-width: 1000px) { .svc-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr) !important; } }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .svc-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; } }
</style>

<!-- WHY -->
<section style="padding:84px 24px;background:#fff;">
  <div class="why-grid" style="max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 0.9fr;gap:64px;align-items:center;">
    <div>
      <span class="kicker">What Makes Us Different</span>
      <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,40px);margin:0 0 28px;">Capability Across the Whole Rotating Train, From Turbine Hall to Genset House</h2>
      <ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;">
          <li style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2FA34D" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px;"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <div>
              <p style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 4px;">Diagnosis Before Scope</p>
              <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">Vibration data, borescope images, clearance readings and operating records decide the work list before a single part is ordered. That keeps you from paying for a major inspection when a hot gas path inspection would have carried the machine to the next window.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2FA34D" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px;"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <div>
              <p style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 4px;">Work Planned Around Your Outage Window</p>
              <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">Scopes are built backwards from the date your plant can afford to be down, with critical path items, spares lead times and hold points identified in advance. Where the window is too tight for the full scope, we say so in writing and propose what is safely deferrable.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2FA34D" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px;"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <div>
              <p style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 4px;">Spares and Lead Times Stated Up Front</p>
              <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">Long lead items such as bearings, seals, nozzles, diaphragms and control components are listed with expected delivery times in the proposal. You see which items decide the schedule and which can be released later without holding the job.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2FA34D" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px;"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <div>
              <p style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 4px;">Records You Can Hand to the Next Engineer</p>
