<!-- PROCESS -->
<section style="padding:76px 24px;background:#EAF5FB;">
  <div style="max-width:1020px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;">
    <span class="kicker">How It Works</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,38px);margin:0 0 44px;">Three Steps. Most Repairs Done Same Day.</h2>
    <div class="steps-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:32px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:34px 26px;box-shadow:0 4px 18px rgba(10,61,92,0.08);">
        <div style="width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:50%;background:#2FA34D;color:#fff;font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 16px;">1</div>
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 10px;">Enquiry and Technical Discussion</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">You tell us the machine class, rating, running hours, symptoms and the outage window you are working towards. An engineer goes through operating data, trip history and previous inspection reports with your maintenance team before any figure is discussed.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:34px 26px;box-shadow:0 4px 18px rgba(10,61,92,0.08);">
        <div style="width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:50%;background:#2FA34D;color:#fff;font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 16px;">2</div>
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 10px;">Site Survey and Scope Definition</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">We attend site to take vibration readings, borescope the machine where access allows, check alignment, protection settings and auxiliaries, and confirm condition against your records. The output is a defined scope of work with the findings that justify each line item.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:34px 26px;box-shadow:0 4px 18px rgba(10,61,92,0.08);">
        <div style="width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:50%;background:#2FA34D;color:#fff;font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 16px;">3</div>
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 10px;">Written Proposal and Execution</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">You receive a technical proposal in Naira setting out scope, spares with lead times, manpower, duration and hold points, so it can be compared line by line against other bids. On award we mobilise to the agreed window and close out with full inspection and handover records.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
